{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>各位餃子控，你哋命中注定嘅手袋終於出現啦！美國潮牌 ESENES WORLDWIDE 推出咗一款極具話題性又神還原嘅「仿真餃子手袋」！🥟手袋採用咗帶有微光澤感嘅晶瑩透亮外皮，甚至連入面嘅「綠色菜餡」都做埋出嚟，若隱若現咁樣，簡直好似剛蒸好嘅水晶餃一樣！打開手袋，裡面都係餡料嘅布料！睇完真係不自覺流晒口水～拎住佢出街打卡，保證回頭率 100%！</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178750097429652291_19187332166a8b19aef2217.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178750097668465300_21370609706a8b19b1883ee.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178750098003667785_15357931136a8b19b503497.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文 新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-23T16:18:39.024401+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":237,"images":3,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none"}}